          "heading": "Check 13: Recycling accounting and real product yield",
          "content": "## Check 13: Recycling accounting and real product yield\n\nWith 140 t/day incoming waste, 22% target recoverable fraction, 65% capture and 85% saleable process yield, expected output is 17.02 t/day. If market rejection rises and effective yield drops to 60%, output becomes about 12.01 t/day. Measure moisture and contamination using appropriate sampling instead of assuming those yields. Recovered mass at the facility gate is not automatically equivalent to virgin material displaced: buyer acceptance and actual reuse or conversion must be documented."
